        "original_id": "f2fd89f1-b82f-5f89-afe1-ec43ac96087e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Hotcourses Group, Hotcourses Ltd\n- People: Jeremy Hunt, Mike Elms\n- Places: Fulham, South West Surrey\n- Roles: Secretary of State for Health, Member of Parliament\n- Topics: educational guidance, course databases, British politics\n\nFacts:\n- Jeremy Hunt was born on 1 November 1966.\n- Hotcourses Ltd was founded in 1996 by Jeremy Hunt and Mike Elms.\n- Hotcourses Group is the public name for Hotcourses Ltd.\n- Hotcourses Ltd is an educational guidance company based in Fulham.\n- Hotcourses Ltd operates the world’s largest course database.\n- Jeremy Hunt has been the Member of Parliament for South West Surrey since 2005.\n- Jeremy Hunt is a British Conservative Party politician.\n- Jeremy Hunt has been the Secretary of State for Health since 2012.",
